# Atmos Weather App — environment variables
#
# By default the app uses Open-Meteo, which is FREE and requires NO API KEY.
# Everything just works out of the box.
#
# Optional: switch to OpenWeatherMap if you prefer (get a free key at openweathermap.org).
# Uncomment both lines below and the app will use OWM instead.

# VITE_WEATHER_PROVIDER=openweathermap
# VITE_OPENWEATHERMAP_API_KEY=your_key_here
